  "slug": "tzatziki-guacamole",
  "name": "Tzatziki Guacamole",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "Fans of avocados and garlic will love this tzatziki makeover inspired by guacamole and loaded with fresh cilantro, mint, and dill.",
  "cuisine": "American Greek",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Combine avocados, garlic, and lemon juice in a bowl; mash into a paste using a fork or spoon. Mix in yogurt and sour cream. Stir in cucumber, mint, dill, cilantro, red pepper flakes. Season with salt and pepper. Cover and refrigerate for at least 1 hour before serving."
    }
  ],
  "servings": 10,
